title: Stabilisation
subtitle: The budget or the currency is in crisis.
new-page: true
tags: pl_event
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && PolishProjects.stabilizationEventDue(Q) !}
on-arrival: {!
// Event economy.stabilization (technical reference 17.3, 17.13 B14, 11.9; card catalogue 9.11): a
// financial crisis without a currency reform. With the Treasury PPS chooses the variant of the one
// reform (the answer is free; the launch costs the ordinary action and B); without it the cabinet may
// prepare the reform itself (17.16.4) and PPS answers its package with the Budget card.
Q.pl_ev_treasury = PolishProjects.ppsHolds(Q.S, 'finance') ? 1 : 0;
Q.pl_ev_terms_why = PolishProjects.eventStatus(Q, 'stabilization', 'protections_terms').reason;
Q.pl_ev_protected_why = PolishProjects.eventStatus(Q, 'stabilization', 'protected').reason;
!}

= A financial crisis

The budget has stayed below −2 B, or inflation at 20% a month or more, for two settlements. A currency reform is now possible: one project, prepared and then launched with the currency law and its financing.

[? if pl_ev_treasury : PPS holds the Treasury and chooses the variant now. The launch waits in the agenda. ?]

[? if not pl_ev_treasury : PPS does not hold the Treasury. The cabinet may prepare the reform itself; its package will come before the Sejm, where PPS can answer it with the Budget card if it sits in the cabinet or supports it. ?]

- @rapid_cuts
- @protected
- @gradual
- @protections_terms
- @wait

@rapid_cuts
title: Rapid stabilisation with savings
subtitle: 2 B for 3 months; needs cuts of at least 1 B; a credit shock +10 for 3 months.
view-if: pl_ev_treasury
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.eventStatus(Q, 'stabilization', 'rapid_cuts').available !}
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.eventChoose(Q, 'stabilization', 'rapid_cuts');
!}
go-to: result

@protected
title: Stabilisation with protections and a burden on wealth
subtitle: 2 B for 3 months; needs a protection for the unemployed and its financing.
view-if: pl_ev_treasury
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.eventStatus(Q, 'stabilization', 'protected').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_ev_protected_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.eventChoose(Q, 'stabilization', 'protected');
!}
go-to: result

@gradual
title: Gradual limitation of emission
subtitle: 1 B for 5 months; a credit shock +5 for 5 months; the marka pressure lasts longer.
view-if: pl_ev_treasury
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.eventStatus(Q, 'stabilization', 'gradual').available !}
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.eventChoose(Q, 'stabilization', 'gradual');
!}
go-to: result

@protections_terms
title: Offer toleration for protections and a burden on wealth
subtitle: Opens the formation card with Grabski tolerated by PPS; the terms, their conditions and the usual cost of the offer apply there.
view-if: not pl_ev_treasury
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.eventStatus(Q, 'stabilization', 'protections_terms').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_ev_terms_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.eventChoose(Q, 'stabilization', 'protections_terms');
!}
go-to: polish_cabinet_formation

@wait
title: Leave the reform to the cabinet
subtitle: PPS answers the cabinet's package when it comes.
view-if: not pl_ev_treasury
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.eventChoose(Q, 'stabilization', 'wait');
!}
go-to: result

@result
new-page: true

= A financial crisis

[+ pl_gc_result +]

- @root: Continue.
